    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stop the spinning\"... what does that even mean? like, how do you even stop it? every time i think about taking a break or something, the interest rates just climb higher and the landlord is already breathing down my neck. it feels like the only way to actually \"stop\" is to just not exist in the system anymore. like, if i'm not part of the economy, the debt doesn't matter, right?",
