    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to see a \"drastic change\" that isn't just more debt. like if i quit i end up on the street, and if i stay i just die a little bit every day. when you say \"making the pressure lift\"... it's like you're saying there's a way to actually get some peace from all this math. is there really just no other way to get out of the cycle?",
