      "content": "There is no magic button to erase the math, but there are ways to change the equation entirely. The cycle only continues because you are forcing yourself to keep participating in the terms that are crushing you. Peace isn't found by balancing the budget; it's found by refusing to play the game that is designed to break you. Look at the options not as 'staying or failing,' but as 'which version of this pain is more tolerable?'",
      "source": "target",
